flowchart TD
    A[Power On / Reset] --> B[Boot Entry Init]
    B --> C[INIT]
    C --> D[Porting Check and Gap Report]
    D --> E[WAIT_USB]
    E -->|USB Ready| F[LOAD_PACKAGE]
    E -->|Timeout / Not Ready| E
    F --> G[VERIFY_PACKAGE]
    G --> H[PROGRAM_EXT_FLASH]
    H --> I[MAP_XIP]
    I --> J[JUMP_APP]
    J --> K[Application Start]

    F --> X[ERROR]
    G --> X
    H --> X
    I --> X
    J --> X

    X --> Y[Diagnostics Snapshot + Gap Mask]
